<title>USA: Topro names Douglas Kelsall as CFO.</title>
<headline>Topro names Douglas Kelsall as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Topro Inc said Thursday it has named Douglas Kelsall as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kelsall comes to the company from the position of chief financial officer and vice-president of finance at privately-held Evolving Systems Inc, a computer software developer.</p>
<p>The company said he succeeds John Walker, who resigned. Topro gave no reason for the resignation.</p>
